    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No. 55 Heathfield, beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached family home, located in a sought-after part of Kinnegad with easy access to M4 & M6 motorways. This attractive property overlooking a green area is immaculately presented from the outside in, including new front door, tarmac driveway, walled front garden, pedestrian side gate and a well-maintained East facing back garden.\n\nA bright welcoming hallway with tiled flooring, carpeted stairs and guest WC with tiled floor and wash hand basin. The main living room is a generous and light-filled space with wood laminate floor, timber surround fireplace with solid fuel open fire. Double doors lead to the open plan kitchen/dining area with ample storage with fitted units on both sides of the room, tiled splash back and flooring, kitchen appliances included and new French doors in dining area.\n\nUpstairs, the home continues with three bright bedrooms with laminate flooring and storage is in no short supply with generous, fitted wardrobes in all bedrooms. The master suite benefits from a contemporary, tiled en-suite with wash hand basin, WC and new power shower. A stylish family bathroom, newly renovated, fully tiled, features a WC, vanity unit, and corner shower cubicle with electric shower and doors\n\nPresented in pristine, showhouse condition, this home includes some kitchen appliances, blinds, and garden shed. The property is ideally located close to the GAA pitch, shops and everyday amenities. With primary school on your doorstep and easy access to larger towns via well-connected roadways, this is an ideal opportunity, and viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nEnt Hall 4.5m x 1.2m (14'9\" x 3'11\"): A welcoming bright area with tiled floor, new PVC front door & glazed side panel.\n\nGUEST WC\nFully tiled Wc & WHB, window.\n\nLiving Room 5.16m x 3.34m (16'11\" x 10'11\"): a spacious bright room with welcoming open fire with timber surround. Quality T & G flooring.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room 5.25m x 4.62m (17'3\" x 15'2\"): Another bright spacious area with tiled floor & a good range of fitted units incorporating electric cooker, extractor fan, Fridge freezer & washing machine.\nnew French doors to large spacious East facing back garden.\n\nLanding bright & spacious with side window, Shelved Hot press\n\nMaster Bedroom 3.1m x 3.1m (10'2\" x 10'2\"): To the back of the house overlooking the back garden with fitted wardrobes & ensuite\n\nEn-Suite Bathroom Fully tiled with WC, WHB & newly installed electric shower\n\nBedroom 2 4.4m x 2.6m (14'5\" x 8'6\"): Fully fitted wardrobes. laminated timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 2.16m x 2.16m (7'1\" x 7'1\"): Fitted wardrobes. laminated timber flooring.\n\nFamily bathroom 2.64m x 2m (8'8\" x 6'7\"): Recently renovated family bathroom, fully tiled with shower unit, electric shower, vanity unit with sink & WC.\n\nSpecial Features & Services\n• OUTSIDE\n• Front garden\n• Large tarmac driveway\n• Lawned area\n•\n• Back garden\n• East facing\n• Lawn & Patio area\n• Large Garden Shed\n• New OFCH boiler.\n• Easily managed\n•\n• FEATURES\n• - Walls Pumped with insulation\n• - new OFCH Boiler\n• - New Showers\n• - New Front door\n• & Patio Door\n• - Extra wide side access\n•\n• INCLUDED\n• All electrical appliances\n• Carpets, Curtains & Blinds\n\nBER C3 no. 108083924"
      },
